@context: The whole hunt runs once per CSV row; row columns are {placeholders}.
@title: data_driven_login
@tags: smoke, data
@data: ../data/users.csv

STEP 1: Log in as {username}
    NAVIGATE to {base_url}/index.html
    FILL 'Username' field with '{username}'
    FILL 'Password' field with '{password}'
    CHECK the checkbox for 'Remember me'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, {username}' is present
    VERIFY 'Role' field has value '{expected_role}'
    CLICK the 'Logout' button

DONE.
